  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YSXHWf5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1022\" height=\"104\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/titanium\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/依賴-titanium-E04E14?labelColor=2D2D2D&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/266515.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/Buuz135mods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Buuz135mods?color=E04E14&labelColor=2D2D2D&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/buuz135\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DONATE-PATREON-E04E14?labelColor=2D2D2D&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/4tPfwjn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/357597633566605313?color=E04E14&labelColor=2D2D2D&label=加入 Discord&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"227\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Industrial Foregoing</strong> 是一個讓你自動化大部分 Minecraft 功能的模組。它擁有應有盡有的機器！</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>生物</strong>與<strong>動物</strong>養殖</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>植物</strong>種植</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一系列<strong>無限工具</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>大型</strong>物品/流體儲存及物品/流體運輸</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>能量</strong>產生</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>附魔</strong>分類與製作</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">還有更多……</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xtfdUxC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"590\" height=\"63\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">要開始使用 Industrial Foregoing，你需要使用樹液萃取器收集乳膠，將其放置在原木前方，然後使用乳膠處理單元，加入一些水和能量，製作小堆橡膠。閱讀手冊以了解更多資訊。</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Mvwn2ZQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1308\" height=\"660\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">紋理由 CyanideX 與 Unity 團隊提供&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://crafttweaker.readthedocs.io/en/latest/#Mods/Industrial_Foregoing/IndustrialForegoing/\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftTweaker 支援</a></span></p>",
